#. module: xpago
msgid ""
"<strong>Connect your XPago account.</strong>\n"
"                        Write the XPago key (it starts with xpk_) that you get when you connect your account: until\n"
"                        then, payments with XPago do not go through."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Conecta tu cuenta XPago.</strong>\n"
"                        Escribe la llave XPago (empieza con xpk_) que recibes al conectar tu cuenta: mientras\n"
"                        tanto, los cobros con XPago no pasan."

#. module: xpago
msgid ""
"<strong>Neutralized copy.</strong>\n"
"                    This database is a copy: XPago was switched off, its key removed and the payments that were waiting\n"
"                    were cancelled here, without calling XPago. Write a test key (xpk_test_…) to try XPago in this copy."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Copia neutralizada.</strong>\n"
"                    Esta base de datos es una copia: XPago se apagó, se quitó su llave y los pagos que estaban\n"
"                    esperando se cancelaron aquí, sin llamar a XPago. Escribe una llave de prueba (xpk_test_…) para\n"
"                    probar XPago en esta copia."

